# Tell git these are binary, so it never attempts a diff or a three-way merge on
# them. Deliberately no `text` / `text=auto` rules: adding those renormalizes
# line endings across the whole repository and turns every tracked file into a
# full rewrite in the next diff, which buries real changes.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.mov   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.zip   binary

